# Spring Framework App – Project 1

## Author
Farouk Shehata 74666

## Description
This project is a simple Spring Boot application created using Spring Framework.

The application demonstrates:
- creating a Spring Boot project,
- creating controllers,
- handling HTTP GET requests,
- using the @ResponseBody annotation,
- returning HTML views using Thymeleaf,
- displaying static resources like images.

